1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,933
Nana had lived in that mall for a
year. Every night she cranked the
carousel, so that someone could see
the light. And she kept a ticket for
one more stop on Route 9.

2
00:00:10,433 --> 00:00:16,067
A town on no map. Where every clock
said 6:40. That was the minute I
started to hate.
